# Do not start the server or build

Never run commands that start the app or produce a build. The user starts those.

Do not run:

- `npm run dev`, `next dev`, or any other dev-server start
- `npm run build`, `next build`, `npm start`, or `next start`
- A restart of a server you started earlier

Editing files is fine. Checking types or lint is fine when it does not start a server or build.
